    "name": "Aptly App Schema API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Aptly API lets you read and write cards on any Aptly board from external systems.\n\nAll requests require an API key passed as the `x-token` header.\nAPI keys are scoped to your company and work across all boards.\n",
